Error [E2393]: use project.<module> needs an owning project context.
  --> orphan.jet:1:5
    |
  1 | use project.services as services
    |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: project-local imports are resolved from the nearest package or workspace graph; an isolated file has no declared project root to resolve them from.
 Fix: run jet check from the package or workspace, or replace the import with the canonical file-relative form when the dependency is local to this file.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E2393

